The System in One Page.

25
00:02:37.769 --> 00:02:39.049
What BSS does.

26
00:02:39.329 --> 00:02:42.827
When you open a video on your phone, the network carries the bytes.

27
00:02:43.107 --> 00:02:55.673
The BSS decides: are you allowed to use data now? how much can you use before checking again? at what speed? what does it cost? and, at the end of the month or the recharge validity, what do you owe or have left?

28
00:02:57.023 --> 00:03:04.340
It must answer the network in milliseconds for millions of sessions at once, and never let usage run free or charge twice.

