Long-running, compensating.

446
00:37:37.392 --> 00:37:38.523
Databases.

447
00:37:38.803 --> 00:37:39.635
Choice:

448
00:37:39.915 --> 00:37:43.477
PostgreSQL or Oracle (legacy), sharded; Redis.

449
00:37:43.757 --> 00:37:44.568
