Fraud and usage alerts.

461
00:37:59.192 --> 00:38:00.387
Lake or warehouse.

462
00:38:00.667 --> 00:38:01.499
Choice:

463
00:38:01.779 --> 00:38:06.280
Iceberg or Hudi + Spark + Trino, or ClickHouse for aggregates.

464
00:38:06.560 --> 00:38:07.371
