Churn, offers, fraud.

471
00:38:16.968 --> 00:38:17.672
Apps.

472
00:38:17.952 --> 00:38:18.784
Choice:

473
00:38:19.064 --> 00:38:23.203
Native self-care apps; USSD and IVR channels for feature phones.

474
00:38:23.483 --> 00:38:24.293
Notes:

475
00:38:24.573 --> 00:38:25.491
Inclusion.

476
00:38:26.841 --> 00:38:27.779
Platform.

477
00:38:28.059 --> 00:38:28.891
Choice:

478
